+                "Traction: 291★ and 55+ customers.",
+                "MRR is $4,000.",
+                "GitHub: 1,754 stars (as of 2026-07-13).",
+                "3. Installs global skills.",
+                "> Quoted: 10 users.",
+                "Run `seed --users 5 users` once.",
+                "```",
+                "40 stars",
+                "```",
+                "## 2026-07-01 snapshot",
+                "12 open deals.",
